        "eng": "Video adaptation of Fusanosuke Inariya's Hyakujitsu no Bara (Maiden Rose) manga. The military story centers on the relationship between Commander Taki Reizen of the 15th Armored Division \"Rosen Maiden\" and Klaus \"Mad Dog\" von Wolfstadt, a knight and Taki's faithful subordinate.",
